@startuml state-cycle
' CampusSwap - State diagram: the status of one swap chain (cycle)
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFF0F2
  BorderColor #FF385C
  ArrowColor #475569
  FontStyle bold
  AttributeFontStyle plain
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7EB
  BorderColor #FFA114
}

state "proposed" as Proposed : deadline = time of the round + 48 hours\nentry / every member's answer = pending
state "confirmed" as Confirmed : every member accepted;\nwaiting for the warden
state "approved" as Approved : seats have changed hands;\nrequests are completed
state "dissolved" as Dissolved : chain cancelled; members go back\nto the pool or are withdrawn

[*] --> Proposed : a saved TTC round\nfinds the chain
Proposed --> Proposed : a member accepts\n[others still pending]
Proposed --> Confirmed : the last pending\nmember accepts
Proposed --> Dissolved : any member declines
Proposed --> Dissolved : deadline passes\n[checked when a round runs\nor any member answers]
Confirmed --> Approved : warden approves
Approved --> [*]
Dissolved --> [*]

note right of Confirmed
  A confirmed chain no longer
  expires. It waits for the
  warden's approval.
end note
@enduml
